  "method": "Read big-endian header and slot indices from every canonical schedule gate in order. Propagate the maximum parent AND depth, adding one only at an AND. Reused slots overwrite their prior depth. Match every counted AND to the independent exported resource record.",
  "limits": [
    "Serial circuit depth follows the current core sequence. A new backend may batch independent polynomials.",
    "GMW and ABY2.0 require private two-party preprocessing and all share conversions. Those costs remain unmeasured.",
    "Three-halves adds computation and uses a different garbling assumption/implementation that needs review.",
    "No round latency, CPU cost, Worker portability, signature latency, or production ranking follows from these formulas."
  ],
